WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Forward heavy punch hits as a Punish Counter.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.800
Back heavy punch connects as a separate link.

3
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.300
HP Sonic Hurricane starts the juggle.

4
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.300
The first Hurricane lifts Manon for the continuation.

5
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.550
Guile activates medium-punch Sonic Hurricane after the HP version.

6
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.650
The second Hurricane continues the airborne combo.

7
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.100
Manon falls at the end of the double-Super route.
